{"seq":2,"slug":"wasm","title":"WebAssembly 与 Rust","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/wasm","wordCount":1020,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"webassembly-与-rust\">WebAssembly 与 Rust</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WebAssembly（Wasm）是一种可移植的二进制指令格式，Rust 因其无 GC、内存可控、产物小，成为编译到 Wasm 的主流语言之一。理解本篇的关键，是把 Wasm 看成<strong>一个沙箱化的执行目标</strong>：它的价值不仅在于浏览器中的性能，更在于&quot;一次编译，到处运行&quot;加上默认无权限的隔离模型。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>两类目标方向不同</strong>：<code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code> 面向浏览器/JS 环境，<code>wasm32-wasip1</code> 面向服务端与边缘计算。</li>\n<li><strong>互操作有边界成本</strong>：<code>wasm-bindgen</code> 处理 Rust 与 JS 的类型转换，跨边界的数据传递涉及线性内存拷贝，因此应尽量在 Wasm 内完成批量计算。</li>\n<li><strong>沙箱即安全模型</strong>：WASI 基于 capability-based security，默认无文件与网络访问，权限必须由运行时显式授予。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"rust-与-webassembly\">Rust 与 WebAssembly</h2><p>Rust 是编译到 WebAssembly（Wasm）的最佳语言之一。没有垃圾回收、可控的内存管理、编译后体积小，使 Rust 在 Wasm 场景中具有显著优势。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Rust + Wasm</th>\n<th>JavaScript</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行速度</td>\n<td>接近原生</td>\n<td>JIT 优化后较快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>很小（可到 KB 级）</td>\n<td>取决于框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存管理</td>\n<td>确定性释放</td>\n<td>垃圾回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>编译期保证</td>\n<td>运行时动态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>计算密集、图形、解码</td>\n<td>DOM 操作、UI 交互</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Wasm 的核心优势在于&quot;一次编译，到处运行&quot;的可移植性。Rust 编译生成的 <code>.wasm</code> 二进制可在浏览器、Node.js、Deno、边缘计算节点（Cloudflare Workers、Fastly Compute）甚至嵌入式系统中执行，无需修改代码。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工具链设置\">工具链设置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 wasm 目标&#10;rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown&#10;&#10;# 安装 wasm-pack&#10;cargo install wasm-pack&#10;&#10;# 安装 wasm-bindgen CLI（可选）&#10;cargo install wasm-bindgen-cli\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 wasm 目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rustup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wasm32-unknown-unknown</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 wasm-pack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wasm-pack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 wasm-bindgen CLI（可选）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wasm-bindgen-cli</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasm-bindgen-rust-与-js-互操作\">wasm-bindgen：Rust 与 JS 互操作</h2><p><code>wasm-bindgen</code> 是 Rust 和 JavaScript 之间互操作的核心桥梁。它自动生成胶水代码，处理 Rust 和 JS 之间的类型转换——包括字符串的 UTF-8/UTF-16 转换、结构体到 JS 对象的映射、以及错误传播。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn greet(name: &amp;str) -&gt; String {&#10;    format!(&quot;你好, {}! 来自 Rust Wasm&quot;, name)&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub struct Calculator {&#10;    value: f64,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;impl Calculator {&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]&#10;    pub fn new() -&gt; Calculator {&#10;        Calculator { value: 0.0 }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn add(&amp;mut self, n: f64) {&#10;        self.value += n;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn result(&amp;self) -&gt; f64 {&#10;        self.value&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn greet(name: &#x26;str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format!(\"你好, {}! 来自 Rust Wasm\", name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct Calculator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value: f64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Calculator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new() -> Calculator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Calculator { value: 0.0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn add(&#x26;mut self, n: f64) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.value += n;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn result(&#x26;self) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>JavaScript 端使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import init, { greet, Calculator } from &#39;./pkg/my_wasm.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function main() {&#10;  await init();&#10;  console.log(greet(&#39;World&#39;));&#10;&#10;  const calc = new Calculator();&#10;  calc.add(10);&#10;  calc.add(20);&#10;  console.log(`结果: ${calc.result()}`);&#10;}&#10;main();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> init, { greet, Calculator } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './pkg/my_wasm.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'World'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> calc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Calculator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`结果: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">calc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">result</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>需要注意的是，Wasm 和 JS 之间的数据传递涉及线性内存拷贝。对于大量数据（如图像像素、音频采样），应尽量在 Wasm 侧完成处理后再传回 JS，避免频繁的跨边界数据拷贝成为瓶颈。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasm-pack-构建流程\">wasm-pack 构建流程</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 构建面向浏览器的包&#10;wasm-pack build --target web&#10;&#10;# 构建面向 npm 的包&#10;wasm-pack build --target bundler&#10;&#10;# 构建面向 Node.js 的包&#10;wasm-pack build --target nodejs\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建面向浏览器的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建面向 npm 的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建面向 Node.js 的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nodejs</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Rust 源码&quot;] --&gt;|wasm-pack build| B[&quot;Wasm 二进制&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;JS 绑定代码&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;TypeScript 类型定义&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;npm 包 / Web 应用&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E\">graph LR\n    A[\"Rust 源码\"] --&gt;|wasm-pack build| B[\"Wasm 二进制\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"JS 绑定代码\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"TypeScript 类型定义\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"npm 包 / Web 应用\"]\n    D --&gt; E</pre><p>构建目标对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Target</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>模块系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>web</code></td>\n<td>直接在浏览器中使用</td>\n<td>ES Module</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bundler</code></td>\n<td>通过 webpack/vite 打包</td>\n<td>ES Module</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nodejs</code></td>\n<td>Node.js 环境</td>\n<td>CommonJS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>no-modules</code></td>\n<td>无模块系统的浏览器</td>\n<td>全局变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"调用-web-api\">调用 Web API</h2><p>通过 <code>web-sys</code> 和 <code>js-sys</code> 调用浏览器 API。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;use web_sys::{Document, Element, HtmlElement};&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen(start)]&#10;pub fn main() -&gt; Result&lt;(), JsValue&gt; {&#10;    let window = web_sys::window().unwrap();&#10;    let document = window.document().unwrap();&#10;    let body = document.body().unwrap();&#10;&#10;    let div = document.create_element(&quot;div&quot;)?;&#10;    div.set_text_content(Some(&quot;Hello from Rust!&quot;));&#10;    div.set_attribute(&quot;style&quot;, &quot;color: blue; font-size: 24px;&quot;)?;&#10;&#10;    body.append_child(&amp;div)?;&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use web_sys::{Document, Element, HtmlElement};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen(start)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn main() -> Result&#x3C;(), JsValue> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let window = web_sys::window().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let document = window.document().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let body = document.body().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let div = document.create_element(\"div\")?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    div.set_text_content(Some(\"Hello from Rust!\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    div.set_attribute(\"style\", \"color: blue; font-size: 24px;\")?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    body.append_child(&#x26;div)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml&#10;[dependencies]&#10;wasm-bindgen = &quot;0.2&quot;&#10;web-sys = { version = &quot;0.3&quot;, features = [&quot;Document&quot;, &quot;Element&quot;, &quot;HtmlElement&quot;, &quot;Window&quot;] }&#10;js-sys = &quot;0.3&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wasm-bindgen = \"0.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>web-sys = { version = \"0.3\", features = [\"Document\", \"Element\", \"HtmlElement\", \"Window\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>js-sys = \"0.3\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>web-sys</code> 通过 cargo feature flags 按需启用 Web API 绑定，未启用的 API 不会增加编译产物体积。这种设计让开发者可以精确控制依赖的 API 范围，同时享受完整的类型安全。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasi-服务端-wasm\">WASI：服务端 Wasm</h2><p>WASI（WebAssembly System Interface）将 Wasm 扩展到服务端和边缘计算场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 WASI 目标&#10;rustup target add wasm32-wasip1&#10;&#10;# 编译 WASI 程序&#10;cargo build --target wasm32-wasip1 --release&#10;&#10;# 使用 wasmtime 运行&#10;wasmtime target/wasm32-wasip1/release/my_app.wasm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 WASI 目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rustup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wasm32-wasip1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译 WASI 程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wasm32-wasip1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 wasmtime 运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/wasm32-wasip1/release/my_app.wasm</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Wasm 运行时</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Wasmtime</td>\n<td>Bytecode Alliance 官方</td>\n<td>通用服务端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wasmer</td>\n<td>支持多编译后端</td>\n<td>插件系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WasmEdge</td>\n<td>针对边缘计算优化</td>\n<td>IoT、边缘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V8</td>\n<td>浏览器引擎内置</td>\n<td>Web 前端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>WASI 的沙箱安全模型基于 capability-based security：程序默认无法访问任何文件系统或网络资源，必须由运行时显式授予目录访问权限（<code>--dir</code> 参数）。这使得 Wasm 模块天然适合作为插件系统的执行沙箱——宿主程序精确控制插件的权限边界。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasm-优化\">Wasm 优化</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 wasm-opt 优化&#10;wasm-opt -Oz -o optimized.wasm input.wasm&#10;&#10;# Cargo.toml 配置&#10;[profile.release]&#10;opt-level = &quot;z&quot;      # 最小体积&#10;lto = true&#10;strip = true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 wasm-opt 优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-opt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -Oz</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> optimized.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Cargo.toml 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opt-level</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"z\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 最小体积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lto</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>opt-level = &quot;z&quot;</code></td>\n<td>最小化体积</td>\n<td>Cargo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LTO</td>\n<td>跨 crate 优化</td>\n<td>Cargo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-opt</code></td>\n<td>Wasm 级别优化</td>\n<td>Binaryen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wee_alloc</code></td>\n<td>更小的分配器</td>\n<td>crate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>console_error_panic_hook</code></td>\n<td>友好的 panic 信息</td>\n<td>crate</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Rust 凭借无 GC、内存可控与产物小，成为编译到 WebAssembly 的主流语言。</li>\n<li><code>wasm-bindgen</code> 桥接 Rust 与 JS 的类型系统，<code>web-sys</code>/<code>js-sys</code> 以 feature 按需提供 Web API 绑定。</li>\n<li><code>wasm-pack</code> 按 <code>web</code>/<code>bundler</code>/<code>nodejs</code> 等 target 产出可直接使用的 npm 包。</li>\n<li>WASI 把 Wasm 扩展到服务端，其 capability-based 沙箱模型使 Wasm 模块天然适合作为插件系统的隔离执行环境。</li>\n<li>跨 Wasm/JS 边界的数据传递有拷贝成本，批量计算应尽量留在 Wasm 内完成；<code>wasm-opt</code> 与 <code>opt-level = &quot;z&quot;</code> 用于压缩产物体积。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WebAssembly 与 Rust","id":"webassembly-与-rust"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust 与 WebAssembly","id":"rust-与-webassembly"},{"level":2,"text":"工具链设置","id":"工具链设置"},{"level":2,"text":"wasm-bindgen：Rust 与 JS 互操作","id":"wasm-bindgen-rust-与-js-互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"wasm-pack 构建流程","id":"wasm-pack-构建流程"},{"level":2,"text":"调用 Web API","id":"调用-web-api"},{"level":2,"text":"WASI：服务端 Wasm","id":"wasi-服务端-wasm"},{"level":2,"text":"Wasm 优化","id":"wasm-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Cargo 与包管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/cargo"},"next":{"title":"Web 后端 Actix/Axum","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/web-backend"}}